        ('/**\n     * Returns Set based Multimap instance by name.\n     * \n     * @param <K> type of key\n     * @param <V> type of value\n     * @param name - name of object\n     * @return SetMultimap object\n     */', '/**\n     * 按名称返回 Set Multimap 批处理对象。\n     * \n     * @param <K> type of key\n     * @param <V> type of value\n     * @param name 对象名称\n     * @return SetMultimap object\n     */'),
